  tutorials:
  - id: welcome
    title: HEAD CHEF
    body: Cook what the tables order and get it to them before they leave. Press
      YES, CHEF! to close a tip.
  - id: catalog
    title: EQUIPMENT CATALOG
    body: Pick up a miniature and hold it over the floor to see where it goes. Let
      go to buy and place it. Pull the trigger while holding it to place more than
      one.
  - id: grid_snap
    title: FLOOR GRID
    body: Equipment snaps to the floor grid. Turn the miniature to turn the piece;
      the arrow shows the front.
  - id: foundation
    title: HOOKUPS
    body: 'Some equipment needs something under it: tiles under everything, a gas
      line under grills and fryers, a counter under cutting boards, a table under
      place settings.'
  - id: pantry_board
    title: PANTRY LEDGER
    body: 'Everything you have: gold, reputation, cooks, ingredients and cooked dishes.
      A line flashes green when it goes up and red when it goes down.'
  - id: crafting
    title: RECIPE TICKETS
    body: The tickets above a station are its recipes. Green means you have the ingredients.
      Press one to start cooking; the dish goes to the pantry when it's done.
  - id: heat
    title: HEAT
    body: A lit grill or fryer takes a few seconds to heat up. Some recipes won't
      start until it's hot enough.
  - id: neighbor
    title: NEIGHBORS INTERACT
    body: 'Equipment on touching grid cells affects each other every second: sinks
      rinse counters, hot stations heat each other, fridges suffer next to heat,
      bins stink up neighbors. Watch the glowing arcs.'
  - id: fridge
    title: REACH-IN FRIDGE
    body: 'Chill rises while it is powered. Heat sources next to it drain Chill;
      an ice machine next to it boosts it. It is also your cold station: fire the
      Tomato Salad ticket here.'
  - id: sink
    title: SINK
    body: The sink keeps the herb plants next to it watered.
  - id: herbs
    title: HERB PLANT
    body: Grows as long as it has water. Snip it with the shears once it's grown
      to get herbs.
  - id: watering_can
    title: WATERING CAN
    body: Tilt the spout over a herb plant or planter to water it. Dip it into a
      sink to refill its WaterLevel.
  - id: shears
    title: SHEARS
    body: Touch a grown herb plant to snip some herbs.
  - id: spray
    title: SANITIZER SPRAY
    body: Hold TRIGGER to spray. Mist that hits a station raises its Cleanliness.
      Uses Sanitizer - buy more from the supplier.
  - id: extinguisher
    title: FIRE EXTINGUISHER
    body: Hold TRIGGER to blast foam. Every blob that hits a grease fire lowers its
      Intensity. Pressure recharges by itself.
  - id: grease_fire
    title: GREASE FIRE!
    body: Intensity grows every second and burns the station's Integrity. At 0 Integrity
      the station is destroyed. Foam it down with the extinguisher!
  - id: rat
    title: RAT!
    body: Rats plan a path around your equipment toward crates and food scraps. Reaching
      a crate steals from it and lowers Hygiene. Whack it with the rolling pin or
      put mouse traps on its route.
  - id: mousetrap
    title: MOUSE TRAP
    body: A rat that runs into a baited trap is caught (+Hygiene, -1 Bait). Poke
      the trap's ticket to re-bait it with Cheese.
  - id: crate
    title: SUPPLY CRATE
    body: Deliveries show up at the back door. Pry one open with the crowbar to get
      the ingredients inside. Don't leave them too long or they go off.
  - id: cleaver
    title: CROWBAR
    body: Push the flat end into a supply crate to pry it open.
  - id: ingredients
    title: LOOSE INGREDIENTS
    body: Touch them with the basket or drop them in the pantry chute to add them
      to the pantry. Don't leave them lying around.
  - id: basket
    title: HARVEST BASKET
    body: Touch loose ingredients with the basket to collect them.
  - id: mushrooms
    title: WILD MUSHROOMS
    body: They sprout in the damp corner of the loading dock and grow on their own.
      Harvest them with the basket once Growth is 40+, before they rot.
  - id: customer
    title: GUESTS
    body: Guests walk along the carpet runners to a free table with a place setting.
  - id: table
    title: NEW ORDER
    body: This table has ordered and is waiting. Its ticket is now on the rail by
      the pass.
  - id: order_rail
    title: ORDER TICKETS
    body: Each table's order hangs here. Once the dish is cooked, press the ticket
      to plate it.
  - id: conveyor
    title: THE PASS
    body: Plates ride the belt to the dining room. Pick the plate up at the end and
      take it to the table on its label.
  - id: plate_delivery
    title: SERVING
    body: Touch the plate to the right table. If you drop it, you'll have to plate
      it again.
  - id: line_cooks
    title: LINE COOKS
    body: Your idle cooks wait in the staff area. Hire more at the Staff Board.
  - id: call_cook
    title: CALL A COOK
    body: A cook walks over along the mats and joins the station's crew.
  - id: walkway
    title: WALKWAY MATS
    body: Cooks and guests only walk on mats and runners, so keep the staff area,
      stations, door and tables connected.
  - id: ice
    title: ICE MACHINE
    body: Makes Ice while it has water and drops cubes in its tray. Throw a cube
      into the fryer or grill to cool it, or into the fridge to chill it.
  - id: trash
    title: SCRAPS
    body: Prep leaves scraps behind. Throw them in the bin.
  - id: death
    title: GONE
    body: When something runs out completely, like a guest's patience, it's gone
      for good.
  - id: supplier
    title: SUPPLIER
    body: Spend gold here on boxes of ingredients. Each ticket is an instant purchase.
  - id: staff_board
    title: STAFF BOARD
    body: Hire a line cook for gold. They wait in the staff area until you call them.
  - id: wrench
    title: WRENCH
    body: Touch a damaged station to repair 25 Integrity for 1 Spare Part.
  - id: rolling_pin
    title: ROLLING PIN
    body: Swing it at a rat to knock its Health down.
  - id: mallet
    title: DEMOLITION MALLET
    body: Swing it at equipment to remove the top piece of that cell (50% refund).
  - id: temper
    title: CHEF'S TEMPER
    body: Fires, walkouts and dropped plates raise your Temper; it cools down slowly.
      At 100 you have a meltdown and lose Reputation.
  - id: hygiene
    title: HYGIENE
    body: Rats, rot and a stinking bin lower Hygiene. Below 25 the health inspector
      docks Reputation.
  - id: crew
    title: CREW
    body: This station has a cook now. It cooks faster and repeats the last ticket
      by itself.
  - id: caretaking
    title: UPKEEP
    body: Looking after equipment and plants keeps them working.
  - id: harvest
    title: COLLECTED
    body: That went into your pantry.
  - id: collision
    title: BY TOUCH
    body: 'A lot of things here work by touch: plates on tables, cooks on stations,
      ingredients in the chute.'
  - id: intermittent
    title: SOMETHING ARRIVED
    body: Deliveries and guests turn up every so often. Keep an eye on the back door
      and the dining room.
  - id: fryer
    title: DEEP FRYER
    body: Cut potatoes go in here. Wait for the oil to heat up first.
  - id: pass
    title: THE PASS
    body: Orders come in on the ticket rail and plates go out on the belt.
  - id: office
    title: CHEF'S OFFICE PANEL
    body: 'Shortcuts for demos: add gold, stock the pantry, spawn diners, rats or
      deliveries, start a fire, hire a cook, reset the tips.'
  - id: planter
    title: PLANTER BOX
    body: The herbs grow in this. Keep it watered.
  - id: cookware
    title: PANS & POTS
    body: Cookware takes its Heat from the stove underneath. Toss a loose ingredient
      into a stockpot for extra Flavor (faster cooking).
